---
title: "add (Sui Framework: kiosk_extension)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_access: assert self.has_access(cap)
    q_check_access --> q_abort: no access
    q_abort --> [*]: abort ENotOwner
    q_check_access --> q_add_df: has access
    q_add_df --> q_create_ext: Extension(storage=new_bag, permissions, is_enabled=true)
    q_create_ext --> [*]: df::add(uid, ExtensionKey, extension)

    note right of q_add_df
        INV-001: only kiosk owner can install extensions
        INV-002: extension starts enabled by default
        INV-003: permissions bitmap controls place/lock capabilities
        INV-004: extension gets isolated storage (Bag)
    end note
